<view class="container">
  <view class="hud">
    <view class="hud-item">关卡：{{level}} / 100</view>
    <view class="hud-item">分数：{{score}}</view>
    <view class="hud-item">剩余：{{timeLeft}}s</view>
  </view>
  <view class="progress">
    <view class="progress-bar" style="width: {{timePercent}}%;"></view>
  </view>

  <canvas
    class="game-canvas"
    canvas-id="gameCanvas"
    bindtap="handleCanvasTap"
    style="width: {{canvasWidth}}px; height: {{canvasHeight}}px;"
  ></canvas>

  <view class="controls">
    <button class="primary" bindtap="handleStart" disabled="{{isRunning}}">开始</button>
    <button class="ghost" bindtap="handlePause" disabled="{{!isRunning}}">暂停</button>
    <button class="ghost" bindtap="handleReset">重置</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tips">
    小人物自动奔跑，点击赛道切换跑道。金币加分，炸弹减分。每关 30 秒，难度随关卡提升。
  </view>
</view>
